# Scryfall bulk dumps: ~74 MB gzipped, ~600 MB expanded. They are an *input* to
# scripts/build_card_index.py and a download cache, never an artifact worth
# keeping -- the committed ../cards.sqlite is what a fresh clone needs.
#
# This file is the only thing standing between a routine catalog refresh and a
# very large commit. Do not remove it.
*.jsonl
*.jsonl.gz
*.json
*.gz
*.part
